\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Four trust layers, added without removing or bypassing any existing V2X mechanism.} Architecture, drawn to distinguish the existing V2X trust stack (light, solid boxes: PKI, MBD, CP -- each individually correct, none reading message content) from this paper's additions (shaded, dashed-bordered: B1/B2/B3, evidence fusion, and the Trust Decision Engine). Small italic labels give each stage's answered question. Native vector diagram (\texttt  {tikz}); renders identically at any print size and in grayscale.}}{4}{}\protected@file@percent }
